<% content_for :title, "Mean, Median, Mode, Range Calculator — whizwheel" %>

<%#
  Mean, Median, Mode, Range calculator page (spec issue #80, DESIGN.md BLEND). The
  project's first VARIABLE-LENGTH LIST input: a single `numbers` field the user types a
  comma/space/newline-separated list into. There is NO mode picker — one input, one
  submit — so this page has no Stimulus controller; it posts over Turbo and re-renders
  the #result region in place, and works identically without JS (the server parses the
  list and validates). Layout per DESIGN.md §3 — an input column + a results panel
  (≈380px 1fr), collapsing to one column on mobile.

  The list input is a <textarea> rather than a one-line field: a long list of numbers is
  the headline interaction here, so it needs room to wrap and stay readable (DESIGN.md §3
  "let pages breathe"). It carries the same .field-input vocabulary (border-input, focus
  ring → accent, tabular-nums) the numeric fields use, so the figures align as typed.

  Spacing scale (DESIGN.md §3, "targets not minimums"):
    • label → field → submit, the major blocks within the card → mt-8 (Section tier)
    • column gutters / card padding → gap-8 / p-7–p-8 (Layout tier)
%>

<header class="max-w-2xl">
  <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent">Math</p>
  <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink">Mean, Median, Mode, Range Calculator</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
    Enter a list of numbers and get the full set of descriptive statistics —
    <span class="font-semibold text-ink">mean</span>, <span class="font-semibold text-ink">median</span>,
    <span class="font-semibold text-ink">mode</span>, and <span class="font-semibold text-ink">range</span>,
    plus the sum, count, smallest, and largest. Separate values with commas, spaces, or
    new lines. Every answer is computed server-side.
  </p>
</header>

<div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[380px_1fr]">
  <%# ── Input column ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <section class="rounded-[18px] border border-border bg-surface p-7 shadow-[0_10px_34px_rgba(150,110,80,0.12)] sm:p-8">
    <%= form_with url: "/calculators/mean_median_mode_range", scope: :inputs, method: :post do |f| %>
      <div>
        <%= f.label :numbers, "Numbers", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_numbers" %>
        <p id="numbers_hint" class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Separated by commas, spaces, or new lines — e.g. <span class="font-semibold text-ink">10, 2, 38, 23</span>
        </p>
        <%= f.text_area :numbers, id: "inputs_numbers", rows: 5,
              placeholder: "10, 2, 38, 23, 38, 23, 21",
              "aria-describedby": "numbers_hint",
              class: "field-input mt-2 resize-y leading-relaxed" %>
      </div>

      <%# Submit — Section tier above; primary coral button (DESIGN.md §4). %>
      <%= f.submit "Calculate",
            class: "mt-8 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-[13px] bg-primary px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-surface shadow-sm transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent" %>
    <% end %>
  </section>

  <%# ── Results panel (the Turbo target) ─────────────────────────────────── %>
  <section id="result" aria-live="polite">
    <%= render "calculators/result", calc: nil %>
  </section>
</div>
